Z||000000||DXR_DAD||08-18-99||07:41 PM||||Any of you guys in the San Francisco bay area?.<br>If so, what local clubs are you in? Bruce are you in a Fiero club?<br>I went to a Golden Gate Fiero Club meeting last night, they had so nice rides and lots of info. I have never been in a car club before, so I did not know what to expect but they were all real cool about me crashing there meeting, and asked if I wanted to join.<br>They thought my little fiero was nice and well maintained. I give that thanks to this fourm. Should I join? What should I look for in a club?<p><br>Thanks!!
Z||000001||Harry||08-18-99||08:03 PM||||DXR,<br>You should join!<br>Any club is better than none at all, plus the first time you guy's all cruise some place together is a real blast (all in a line).<br>Most club's offer some sort of discount with local dealer's/parts store and the like.<br>We have three dealers that sponser my club here in VA and they have been a really big help not to mention I saved the amount of club due's by my second or third visit to Pontiac.....<br>Long live the plastic wonder!!!!<br>
